            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Patty G"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this recipe but I added more cilantro and a chopped and seeded tomato . The key to success is to use fruit that are firm but not overly ripe because otherwise the salsa is too juicy and therefore runny. I use Italian tomatoes or remove the seeds and inner flesh from my garden tomatoes . I made it a second time and added some chopped, hot pepper."
          },
